silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_05_validation_and_shapes_sections_01_shape_gate_olog_node_concrete_anchor_5#measurementsourceleg silm:hasLongDescription "The MeasurementSourceLeg is The positioned node: MeasurementLeg in its role as an input source leg into D_Mittens, the colimit diagram for Mittens. The leg connects the measurement evidence to the apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ForgeLeg', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
